<span class="ltx_bibblock">Rethinking the bounds of llm reasoning: Are multi-agent discussions the key?

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span id="bib.bib40.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">62nd Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics, ACL 2024</span>, pages 6106–6131. Association for Computational Linguistics (ACL), 2024.

</span></li>
      
