</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">arXiv e-prints</span>, pages arXiv–2502, 2025.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib43" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[43]</span>
