</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib44" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[44]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Sheng-Lun Wei, Cheng-Kuang Wu, Hen-Hsen Huang, and Hsin-Hsi Chen.

